{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-47546","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53583","text":"OpenSentience Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53584","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Intelligence is not generation. It is structured accumulation.\""}]}],"id":"blk-47547","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53585","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-53586","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-53587","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-53588","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-53589","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-53590","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-53591","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-47549","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-47551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53592","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-53593","marks":["bold"],"text":"OpenSentience"},{"id":"spn-53594","text":" — the research arm and runtime governance layer of the [&] Protocol ecosystem."}]},{"id":"blk-47552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53595","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47553","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53596","text":"What Is OpenSentience?"}]},{"id":"blk-47554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53597","text":"OpenSentience is "},{"id":"spn-53598","marks":["bold"],"text":"not a product"},{"id":"spn-53599","text":". It is three things:"}]},{"id":"blk-47555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53600","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-53601","marks":["bold"],"text":"A research organization"},{"id":"spn-53602","text":" that publishes cognitive protocols — formal specifications grounding AI agent architecture in cognitive science. 2. "},{"id":"spn-53603","marks":["bold"],"text":"A thin governance shim"},{"id":"spn-53604","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-53605","marks":["code"],"text":"open_sentience"},{"id":"spn-53606","text":" hex package) that enforces permission, lifecycle, and autonomy policies on OTP-supervised agents. 3. "},{"id":"spn-53607","marks":["bold"],"text":"The home of two cross-cutting protocols"},{"id":"spn-53608","text":" — OS-009 PRISM (diagnostic benchmark) and OS-010 PULSE (loop manifest standard) — that sit above the eight cognitive primitives and turn the [&] portfolio into a measurable, composable, accountable agent substrate."}]},{"id":"blk-47556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53609","text":"The research output is "},{"id":"spn-53610","marks":["bold"],"text":"ten numbered protocols"},{"id":"spn-53611","text":" organized in two layers:"}]},{"id":"blk-47557","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47559","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53612","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cognitive primitives"},{"id":"spn-53613","text":" (OS-001 through OS-008) — one capability each"}]}],"id":"blk-47558","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47561","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53614","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cross-cutting protocols"},{"id":"spn-53615","text":" (OS-009 PRISM, OS-010 PULSE) — diagnostic + temporal layers above the primitives"}]}],"id":"blk-47560","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53616","text":"The runtime output includes the Elixir governance package implementing OS-006 (shim) and OS-008 (harness), the "},{"id":"spn-53617","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM benchmark engine"},{"id":"spn-53618","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-53619","marks":["code"],"text":"/PRISM/"},{"id":"spn-53620","text":", Elixir/OTP, Fly.io, 6 MCP machines), and the "},{"id":"spn-53621","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE manifest standard"},{"id":"spn-53622","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-53623","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/"},{"id":"spn-53624","text":", JSON Schema + reference manifests)."}]},{"id":"blk-47563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53625","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47564","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53626","text":"The Ten Protocols"}]},{"id":"blk-47565","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53627","text":"Cognitive Primitives (OS-001 — OS-008)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-47567","spans":[{"id":"spn-53628","text":"Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-47568","spans":[{"id":"spn-53629","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-47569","spans":[{"id":"spn-53630","text":"Cognitive Basis"}]},{"id":"blk-47570","spans":[{"id":"spn-53631","text":"Implemented By"}]}],"id":"blk-47566","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-47571","spans":[{"id":"spn-53632","text":"OS-001"}]},{"id":"blk-47572","spans":[{"id":"spn-53633","text":"Continual Learning"}]},{"id":"blk-47573","spans":[{"id":"spn-53634","text":"Hippocampal consolidation"}]},{"id":"blk-47574","spans":[{"id":"spn-53635","text":"Graphonomous"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47575","spans":[{"id":"spn-53636","text":"OS-002"}]},{"id":"blk-47576","spans":[{"id":"spn-53637","text":"Topological Routing (κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-47577","spans":[{"id":"spn-53638","text":"Prefrontal gating"}]},{"id":"blk-47578","spans":[{"id":"spn-53639","text":"Graphonomous routing layer"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47579","spans":[{"id":"spn-53640","text":"OS-003"}]},{"id":"blk-47580","spans":[{"id":"spn-53641","text":"Deliberation Orchestrator"}]},{"id":"blk-47581","spans":[{"id":"spn-53642","text":"Dual-process theory"}]},{"id":"blk-47582","spans":[{"id":"spn-53643","text":"AgenTroMatic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47583","spans":[{"id":"spn-53644","text":"OS-004"}]},{"id":"blk-47584","spans":[{"id":"spn-53645","text":"Attention Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-47585","spans":[{"id":"spn-53646","text":"Endogenous attention"}]},{"id":"blk-47586","spans":[{"id":"spn-53647","text":"Graphonomous attention module"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47587","spans":[{"id":"spn-53648","text":"OS-005"}]},{"id":"blk-47588","spans":[{"id":"spn-53649","text":"Model Tier Adaptation"}]},{"id":"blk-47589","spans":[{"id":"spn-53650","text":"Resource rationality"}]},{"id":"blk-47590","spans":[{"id":"spn-53651","text":"Graphonomous / Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47591","spans":[{"id":"spn-53652","text":"OS-006"}]},{"id":"blk-47592","spans":[{"id":"spn-53653","text":"Agent Governance Shim"}]},{"id":"blk-47593","spans":[{"id":"spn-53654","text":"Executive function"}]},{"id":"blk-47594","spans":[{"id":"spn-53655","marks":["code"],"text":"open_sentience"},{"id":"spn-53656","text":" hex package"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47595","spans":[{"id":"spn-53657","text":"OS-007"}]},{"id":"blk-47596","spans":[{"id":"spn-53658","text":"Adversarial Robustness"}]},{"id":"blk-47597","spans":[{"id":"spn-53659","text":"Immune system"}]},{"id":"blk-47598","spans":[{"id":"spn-53660","text":"OpenSentience security module"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47599","spans":[{"id":"spn-53661","text":"OS-008"}]},{"id":"blk-47600","spans":[{"id":"spn-53662","text":"Agent Harness"}]},{"id":"blk-47601","spans":[{"id":"spn-53663","text":"Supervisory attentional system"}]},{"id":"blk-47602","spans":[{"id":"spn-53664","text":"OpenSentience harness module"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-47603","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53665","text":"Cross-Cutting Protocols (OS-009, OS-010)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-47605","spans":[{"id":"spn-53666","text":"Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-47606","spans":[{"id":"spn-53667","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-47607","spans":[{"id":"spn-53668","text":"Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-47608","spans":[{"id":"spn-53669","text":"Implemented By"}]}],"id":"blk-47604","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-47609","spans":[{"id":"spn-53670","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-009"}]},{"id":"blk-47610","spans":[{"id":"spn-53671","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM"},{"id":"spn-53672","text":" — Protocol for Rating Iterative System Memory"}]},{"id":"blk-47611","spans":[{"id":"spn-53673","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnostic algebra"},{"id":"spn-53674","text":" (measures loops over time)"}]},{"id":"blk-47612","spans":[{"id":"spn-53675","marks":["code"],"text":"/PRISM/"},{"id":"spn-53676","text":" Elixir/OTP, Fly.io, 6 MCP machines, "},{"id":"spn-53677","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://prism.opensentience.org"}],"text":"prism.opensentience.org"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47613","spans":[{"id":"spn-53678","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-010"}]},{"id":"blk-47614","spans":[{"id":"spn-53679","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE"},{"id":"spn-53680","text":" — Protocol for Uniform Loop State Exchange"}]},{"id":"blk-47615","spans":[{"id":"spn-53681","marks":["bold"],"text":"Temporal algebra"},{"id":"spn-53682","text":" (declares how loops cycle)"}]},{"id":"blk-47616","spans":[{"id":"spn-53683","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/"},{"id":"spn-53684","text":" manifest standard, JSON Schema, reference manifests, "},{"id":"spn-53685","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://pulse.opensentience.org"}],"text":"pulse.opensentience.org"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-47617","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53686","text":"Each cognitive primitive maps a well-established cognitive science finding to a concrete software architecture. The cross-cutting protocols sit above them: PRISM measures how well a closed memory loop performs over time; PULSE declares how any loop in the [&] ecosystem cycles, nests, and signals across boundaries. Both are independent of one another and independent of [&] — a system may adopt one without the others."}]},{"id":"blk-47618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53687","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47619","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53688","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-47620","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-47621","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-47622","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: OpenSentience Docs\n\narchitecture\nquickstart\npositioning\necosystem-overview\ncompetitive-landscape\nharness-engineering\nruntime-walkthrough\ncomparison-table\nresearch\nfaq\nspec/README\nspec/OS-008-HARNESS\nspec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION\nspec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION\nspec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION"},{"id":"blk-47623","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Skills\n\nskills/SKILLS\nskills/01_PROTOCOLS_OVERVIEW\nskills/02_AGENT_LIFECYCLE\nskills/03_PERMISSIONS\nskills/04_AUTONOMY_LEVELS\nskills/05_AUDIT_TRAILS\nskills/06_INTEGRATION\nskills/07_COGNITIVE_SCIENCE\nskills/08_ANTI_PATTERNS"},{"id":"blk-47624","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53689","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47625","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53690","text":"Suggested Reading Order"}]},{"id":"blk-47626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53691","text":"If you are new to OpenSentience, follow this path:"}]},{"id":"blk-47627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53692","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-53693","marks":["bold"],"text":"This page"},{"id":"spn-53694","text":" — understand scope and structure 2. "},{"id":"spn-53695","marks":["bold"],"text":"positioning"},{"id":"spn-53696","text":" — where OpenSentience fits in the agent governance landscape 3. "},{"id":"spn-53697","marks":["bold"],"text":"architecture"},{"id":"spn-53698","text":" — how the governance shim is built (OTP internals) 4. "},{"id":"spn-53699","marks":["bold"],"text":"quickstart"},{"id":"spn-53700","text":" — install the hex package and run your first governed agent 5. "},{"id":"spn-53701","marks":["bold"],"text":"ecosystem-overview"},{"id":"spn-53702","text":" — how all ten protocols connect across the [&] ecosystem 6. "},{"id":"spn-53703","marks":["bold"],"text":"harness-engineering"},{"id":"spn-53704","text":" — the emerging discipline of harness design and OS-008's position 7. "},{"id":"spn-53705","marks":["bold"],"text":"runtime-walkthrough"},{"id":"spn-53706","text":" — follow a concrete agent through governance + harness orchestration 8. "},{"id":"spn-53707","marks":["bold"],"text":"competitive-landscape"},{"id":"spn-53708","text":" — how OpenSentience compares to alternative approaches 9. "},{"id":"spn-53709","marks":["bold"],"text":"comparison-table"},{"id":"spn-53710","text":" — quick-reference feature comparison 10. "},{"id":"spn-53711","marks":["bold"],"text":"research"},{"id":"spn-53712","text":" — cognitive science grounding for each protocol 11. "},{"id":"spn-53713","marks":["bold"],"text":"faq"},{"id":"spn-53714","text":" — fill in remaining questions 12. "},{"id":"spn-53715","marks":["bold"],"text":"skills/"},{"id":"spn-53716","text":" — hands-on implementation skills for the governance shim"}]},{"id":"blk-47628","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53717","text":"For deep protocol specifics:"}]},{"id":"blk-47629","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47631","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53718","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/README"},{"id":"spn-53719","text":" — the full technical specification (all ten protocols)"}]}],"id":"blk-47630","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47633","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53720","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-008-HARNESS"},{"id":"spn-53721","text":" — the Agent Harness Protocol specification"}]}],"id":"blk-47632","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47635","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53722","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION"},{"id":"spn-53723","text":" — PRISM diagnostic benchmark protocol"}]}],"id":"blk-47634","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47637","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53724","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION"},{"id":"spn-53725","text":" — PULSE loop manifest standard"}]}],"id":"blk-47636","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47639","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53726","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION"},{"id":"spn-53727","text":" — empirical evaluation of topology-aware continual learning"}]}],"id":"blk-47638","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47640","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53728","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47641","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53729","text":"Documentation index"}]},{"id":"blk-47642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53730","text":"Linked index of every page in this set (renders on GitHub and in the docs atlas; the toctrees above drive the Sphinx build):"}]},{"id":"blk-47643","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53731","marks":["bold"],"text":"Guides"}]},{"id":"blk-47644","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47646","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53732","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/quickstart.md"}],"text":"Quickstart"}]}],"id":"blk-47645","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53733","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/runtime-walkthrough.md"}],"text":"Runtime Walkthrough"}]}],"id":"blk-47647","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47650","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53734","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/positioning.md"}],"text":"Positioning — The Missing Constraint: Runtime Governance in the Agent Stack"}]}],"id":"blk-47649","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53735","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/competitive-landscape.md"}],"text":"Competitive Landscape — Agent Governance and Runtime Enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-47651","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47654","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53736","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/comparison-table.md"}],"text":"Comparison — OpenSentience vs. Alternatives"}]}],"id":"blk-47653","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47656","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53737","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/ecosystem-overview.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem Overview — How the Protocols Connect"}]}],"id":"blk-47655","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47658","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53738","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/research.md"}],"text":"Research Overview"}]}],"id":"blk-47657","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53739","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/faq.md"}],"text":"FAQ"}]}],"id":"blk-47659","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47662","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53740","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/SKILLS.md"}],"text":"Agent Skills"}]}],"id":"blk-47661","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47663","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53741","marks":["bold"],"text":"Specifications"}]},{"id":"blk-47664","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53742","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-011-EMBODIMENT.md"}],"text":"OS-011 — Embodiment Protocol"}]}],"id":"blk-47665","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47668","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53743","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION.md"}],"text":"OS-E001 — Empirical Evaluation of Topology-Aware Continual Learning"}]}],"id":"blk-47667","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53744","marks":["bold"],"text":"UX & build prompts"}]},{"id":"blk-47670","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47672","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53745","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/ux/user-stories-embodiment.md"}],"text":"Embodiment (body-browser + body-os) — User Stories"}]}],"id":"blk-47671","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47674","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53746","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/prompts/OS-008-BUILD.md"}],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]}],"id":"blk-47673","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47675","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53747","text":"The Three Enforcement Layers"}]},{"id":"blk-47676","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53748","text":"OpenSentience provides three layers of runtime enforcement:"}]},{"id":"blk-47677","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"OS-008 Harness:   \"Has this agent followed the correct process?\"\n                   Pipeline ordering, quality gates, sprint contracts\n\nOS-006 Shim:      \"Is this agent allowed to do this?\"\n                   Permissions, lifecycle, autonomy levels\n\nOS-007 Security:  \"Is this agent under attack?\"\n                   Threat detection, identity verification, circuit breakers"},{"id":"blk-47678","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53749","text":"All three log to the same append-only audit trail, creating a unified compliance record from protocol to permission to pipeline."}]},{"id":"blk-47679","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53750","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47680","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53751","text":"The Three-Protocol Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-47681","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53752","text":"Above the cognitive primitives, OpenSentience publishes three sibling protocols that together turn the [&] portfolio into a measurable, composable, accountable agent substrate:"}]},{"id":"blk-47682","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  PRISM (OS-009) — measures loops over time   diagnostic │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  PULSE (OS-010) — declares loops + signals    temporal  │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  [&] Protocol     — composes capabilities     structural│\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"head":[{"id":"blk-47684","spans":[{"id":"spn-53753","text":"Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-47685","spans":[{"id":"spn-53754","text":"Question"}]},{"id":"blk-47686","spans":[{"id":"spn-53755","text":"Artifact"}]}],"id":"blk-47683","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-47687","spans":[{"id":"spn-53756","text":"[&]"}]},{"id":"blk-47688","spans":[{"id":"spn-53757","text":"What can each agent do, and how do they compose?"}]},{"id":"blk-47689","spans":[{"id":"spn-53758","marks":["code"],"text":"*.ampersand.json"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47690","spans":[{"id":"spn-53759","text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-47691","spans":[{"id":"spn-53760","text":"How do their processes cycle and signal each other?"}]},{"id":"blk-47692","spans":[{"id":"spn-53761","marks":["code"],"text":"*.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-53762","text":" (loop manifest)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47693","spans":[{"id":"spn-53763","text":"PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-47694","spans":[{"id":"spn-53764","text":"How well do those cycles actually work over time?"}]},{"id":"blk-47695","spans":[{"id":"spn-53765","text":"Diagnostic reports + leaderboards"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-47696","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53766","text":"A loop is "},{"id":"spn-53767","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE-conforming"},{"id":"spn-53768","text":" if its manifest validates against "},{"id":"spn-53769","marks":["code"],"text":"pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-53770","text":" and its runtime passes the 12-test conformance suite. A system is "},{"id":"spn-53771","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM-evaluable"},{"id":"spn-53772","text":" automatically once it is PULSE-conforming — PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-53773","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-53774","text":" phase reads the manifest, injects scenarios at the declared "},{"id":"spn-53775","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-53776","text":" boundary, and observes outcomes via the declared "},{"id":"spn-53777","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-53778","text":" phase. Adoption order is typically [&] → PULSE → PRISM."}]},{"id":"blk-47697","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53779","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47698","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53780","text":"Relationship to the [&] Ecosystem"}]},{"id":"blk-47699","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53781","text":"OpenSentience occupies the "},{"id":"spn-53782","marks":["bold"],"text":"governance and research layer"},{"id":"spn-53783","text":" of the [&] stack:"}]},{"id":"blk-47700","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  [&] Protocol        — capability composition (what an agent CAN do)\n  OpenSentience       — governance + harness (what an agent MAY do, and how)\n  Graphonomous        — memory + learning (OS-001, OS-002, OS-004, OS-005)\n  AgenTroMatic        — deliberation (OS-003)\n  Delegatic           — policy authoring (feeds into OS-006 enforcement)\n  Agentelic           — agent manifests (consumed by OS-006 install)\n  FleetPrompt         — marketplace (agents enter governance on install)\n  SpecPrompt          — acceptance criteria (consumed by OS-008 quality gates)"},{"id":"blk-47701","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53784","text":"The governance shim wraps any OTP "},{"id":"spn-53785","marks":["code"],"text":"child_spec"},{"id":"spn-53786","text":". It does not replace the supervised process — it interposes permission checks, lifecycle management, autonomy control, pipeline enforcement, and audit logging around it."}]},{"id":"blk-47702","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53787","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47703","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-53788","text":"Founding Thesis"}]},{"id":"blk-47704","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53789","text":"OpenSentience exists because intelligence without governance is generation without accumulation. The ten protocols formalize what structured accumulation requires: memory that consolidates, routing that detects cycles, deliberation that resolves conflict, attention that prioritizes, resources that adapt, governance that enforces boundaries, security that detects threats, a harness that orchestrates the entire pipeline, "},{"id":"spn-53790","marks":["bold"],"text":"diagnostics that measure whether the loop actually learns"},{"id":"spn-53791","text":" (PRISM), and a "},{"id":"spn-53792","marks":["bold"],"text":"temporal manifest"},{"id":"spn-53793","text":" that lets every loop in the ecosystem declare how it cycles and signals (PULSE)."}]},{"id":"blk-47705","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-53794","text":"The shim is deliberately thin. Governance should cost less than 1% of the system it governs. PULSE is a manifest standard with no required runtime. PRISM runs as a separate benchmark engine that any system can opt into via its PULSE manifest."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraecn7cj5xy6cl74llrqc5u37jsaksxpfvsle4omfx2gxhnldjamlq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}